267
00:12:07,132 --> 00:12:09,509
Garlic soy sauce in the back, salt and koji in the front

268
00:12:09,593 --> 00:12:11,344
Add lemon and shichimi to your preference.

269
00:12:11,428 --> 00:12:12,637
Itadadakimasu!

270
00:12:12,721 --> 00:12:15,265
Kita-chan, let's eat~ (Kita) Yes~

271
00:12:15,348 --> 00:12:16,016
Уау...

272
